    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFY GRAVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Forge offers the player an extra degree of freedom in both movement and combat. The environment becomes a weapon. You can walk on walls, create gravity wells, change mass, and discover new ways to interact with the world. This is a spatial shooter, spatial imagination is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY ARE LEGION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay hordes of biomechs along with stand-out elite enemies, powered by an internally-brewed technology. We aim for good optimization even on mid-level PCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP FRENZY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing your friends to double the fun, combining your abilities for better effectiveness in a spectacular dance of death. But be careful with explosives and gravity tricks, as friendly fire damage is on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaston City is a beautiful and dangerous place. It\u2019s a technogenic dystopia, visually blending elements of dieselpunk and biopunk with the elegance of Art Nouveau and Art Deco. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Elsa and her squadmates, adventurous treasure hunters. A major heist goes south and the team must face the consequences while dealing with the infamous \u201cLiving Magnet\u201d technology in its deadliest manifestations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use all the capabilities of Unreal Engine 5 to convey the absolute beauty of the game world intertwined with the oppressive atmosphere of a society distorted by technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE FOR THE PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We design the game with passion, aiming for it to be a dense, punchy experience for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as a team that values and stays connected to its community, we look forward to your feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in pre-Alpha, and your feedback can help us shape it in the best way possible. By joining our Discord server, you can expect regular playtests, Q&amp;A sessions with developers, and other events. And unlike the cliched statements of mega-corps, your opinion <strong><i>really</i></strong> matters to us. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So if you're interested in joining the creative process, welcome to our community on Discord!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFY GRAVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Forge offers the player an extra degree of freedom in both movement and combat. The environment becomes a weapon. You can walk on walls, create gravity wells, change mass, and discover new ways to interact with the world. This is a spatial shooter, spatial imagination is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/950cd9b186a16c3eeb4daea768638f90.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY ARE LEGION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay hordes of biomechs along with stand-out elite enemies, powered by an internally-brewed technology. We aim for good optimization even on mid-level PCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/d9a826981c9e0ca312e0e66f18ce2fe1.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP FRENZY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing your friends to double the fun, combining your abilities for better effectiveness in a spectacular dance of death. But be careful with explosives and gravity tricks, as friendly fire damage is on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/3315defbb69834c03bc317996c4d489f.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaston City is a beautiful and dangerous place. It\u2019s a technogenic dystopia, visually blending elements of dieselpunk and biopunk with the elegance of Art Nouveau and Art Deco. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Elsa and her squadmates, adventurous treasure hunters. A major heist goes south and the team must face the consequences while dealing with the infamous \u201cLiving Magnet\u201d technology in its deadliest manifestations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We use all the capabilities of Unreal Engine 5 to convey the absolute beauty of the game world intertwined with the oppressive atmosphere of a society distorted by technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.poster.avif?t=1727360230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.webm?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848760/extras/2c8cc955508ebf9962da17b84d175f3b.mp4?t=1727360230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE FOR THE PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We design the game with passion, aiming for it to be a dense, punchy experience for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as a team that values and stays connected to its community, we look forward to your feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in pre-Alpha, and your feedback can help us shape it in the best way possible. By joining our Discord server, you can expect regular playtests, Q&amp;A sessions with developers, and other events. And unlike the cliched statements of mega-corps, your opinion <strong><i>really</i></strong> matters to us. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So if you're interested in joining the creative process, welcome to our community on Discord!</strong></p>",
